    "updated_at": "2025-08-21T12:24:55Z",
    "body": "That's a good question and definitely one worth answering. I'm honestly not sure.\n\nThough I've also got a separate question (which I'll make into its own issue probably), why can we only label form associated elements (+ progress and meter). It seems at my naive first glance a weird restriction to have in the first place. In some ways I wonder if the list of labelable elements should be larger?",
